# The checked-in release is an owner-private fictional DEMO.
# Copy to .env.local for local commands, or set these in Vercel project settings.
# Leave storage variables unset locally to use the ignored .data directory.
# Vercel requires a hosted libSQL-compatible database; no local fallback is used.
# TURSO_DATABASE_URL=libsql://your-database.turso.io
# TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=your-database-token
# Connect a PRIVATE Vercel Blob store to supply this server-only token.
# BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=your-private-store-token
TEST_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:5173
# External email, routing, payments, identity documents and analytics disabled.
# Demo personas have no shared password; role switching is explicit demo functionality.
# Do not deploy this build as a real marketplace without implementing production auth,
# staff MFA, mail delivery, retention and the launch checks in docs/decisions.md.
